---
---

<section id="features" class="py-20 bg-slate-950/60 border-y border-white/10 relative">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="text-center">
      <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sky-400">Capabilities</p>
      <h2 class="mt-2 font-bold text-3xl text-white sm:text-4xl">Why ClipBoardPrime?</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 mx-auto max-w-4xl rounded-2xl border border-sky-500/25 bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-500/10 via-blue-500/10 to-indigo-500/10 px-5 py-4 text-center shadow-[0_0_35px_rgba(14,165,233,0.10)]">
      <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sky-300">New in v1.0.4</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300">Verified-target paste protection, serialized paste operations, persistent maximized window state, an optional Always on Top mode, and a clearer Settings experience.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <div class="glass rounded-2xl p-6 transition duration-300 hover:border-sky-500/40 hover:-translate-y-1">
        <div class="h-12 w-12 rounded-xl bg-sky-500/10 border border-sky-500/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(14,165,233,0.15)]">
          <svg class="h-6 w-6 text-sky-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-3 7h3m-3 4h3m-6-4h.01M9 16h.01" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-white">Rich Clipboard History</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Monitors text, HTML, URLs, emails, code snippets, and images. Features Space-bar quick preview and instant live fuzzy search.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="glass rounded-2xl p-6 transition duration-300 hover:border-sky-500/40 hover:-translate-y-1">
        <div class="h-12 w-12 rounded-xl bg-sky-500/10 border border-sky-500/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(14,165,233,0.15)]">
          <svg class="h-6 w-6 text-sky-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-white">Verified Win32 Auto-Paste</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Confirms the remembered target still exists and owns focus, queues rapid requests, then pastes through the native SendInput API—otherwise it safely cancels.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="glass rounded-2xl p-6 transition duration-300 hover:border-sky-500/40 hover:-translate-y-1">
        <div class="h-12 w-12 rounded-xl bg-sky-500/10 border border-sky-500/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(14,165,233,0.15)]">
          <svg class="h-6 w-6 text-sky-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M7 7h.01M7 3h5c.512 0 1.024.195 1.414.586l7 7a2 2 0 010 2.828l-7 7a2 2 0 01-2.828 0l-7-7A1.994 1.994 0 013 12V7a4 4 0 014-4z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-white">Notes & Color Categories</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Convert clipboard items into permanent notes, organize with color-coded categories, pin, and favorite important entries.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="glass rounded-2xl p-6 transition duration-300 hover:border-emerald-500/40 hover:-translate-y-1">
        <div class="h-12 w-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(16,185,129,0.15)]">
          <svg class="h-6 w-6 text-emerald-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-white">Hardware-Backed Security</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Encrypt data with Windows safeStorage (DPAPI) & AES-256-GCM. Automatically mask credit cards, API tokens, and sensitive strings.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
